  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Stance. For 5...13...15 seconds, you move 25% faster. Enraging Charge ends when you successfully strike a target, at which point you gain 0...2...3 strike[s] of adrenaline if you hit with a melee attack.",
      "zhTW": "持續 5～15 秒，移動速度增加 25%，當你下一次以近身攻擊擊中敵人時，此態勢終止且你獲得等同於 0～3 次攻擊的怒氣值。"
    },
